time":1.521,"request":{"method":"GET","url":"https://sudokumaker.app/assets/_virtual_changelog-C6E0_gTj.js","httpVersion":"h3","cookies":[],"headers":[{"name":":authority","value":"sudokumaker.app"},{"name":":method","value":"GET"},{"name":":path","value":"/assets/_virtual_changelog-C6E0_gTj.js"},{"name":":scheme","value":"https"},{"name":"accept","value":"*/*"},{"name":"accept-encoding","value":"gzip, deflate, br, zstd"},{"name":"priority","value":"u=1, i"},{"name":"referer","value":"https://sudokumaker.app/sw.js"},{"name":"sec-fetch-dest","value":"empty"},{"name":"sec-fetch-mode","value":"cors"},{"name":"sec-fetch-site","value":"same-origin"},{"name":"user-agent","value":"Mozilla/5.0 (X11; Linux x86_64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) HeadlessChrome/151.0.7922.34 Safari/537.36"}],"queryString":[],"headersSize":-1,"bodySize":-1},"response":{"status":200,"statusText":"","httpVersion":"h3","cookies":[],"headers":[{"name":"access-control-allow-origin","value":"*"},{"name":"alt-svc","value":"h3=\":443\"; ma=86400"},{"name":"cache-control","value":"public, max-age=300, must-revalidate"},{"name":"cf-cache-status","value":"REVALIDATED"},{"name":"cf-ray","value":"a31cd51efc0854bb-IAD"},{"name":"content-encoding","value":"br"},{"name":"content-type","value":"application/javascript"},{"name":"date","value":"Thu, 27 Aug 2026 17:35:24 GMT"},{"name":"etag","value":"W/\"4b95555e117f1c5d69ca4bab0af4e30d\""},{"name":"nel","value":"{\"report_to\":\"cf-nel\",\"success_fraction\":0.0,\"max_age\":604800}"},{"name":"priority","value":"u=1,i"},{"name":"referrer-policy","value":"strict-origin-when-cross-origin"},{"name":"report-to","value":"{\"group\":\"cf-nel\",\"max_age\":604800,\"endpoints\":[{\"url\":\"https://a.nel.cloudflare.com/report/v4?s=3wmXsfbt76%2F7%2BRhOIIOY8RZpocEIhyDRermqXXUXIOfNzl3BeKEs0cyjHFqpBaa%2By4YXkeEPPg%2FFjqeT6nONq5Y%2Fqu6JjLJcP6SfJ4vH3Vt3hor3DkakDI5We%2FK1ZHDAgbE%3D\"}]}"},{"name":"server","value":"cloudflare"},{"name":"server-timing","value":"cfExtPri"},{"name":"vary","value":"Origin"},{"name":"vary","value":"accept-encoding"},{"name":"x-content-type-options","value":"nosniff"}],"content":{"size":-1,"mimeType":"application/javascript","text":"const e={type:\"html\",html:`<h2>Release 2026-08-14</h2>\n<h3>✨ Added</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Counting circles</strong> - Added counting circles constraint</li>\n<li><strong>Constraint Maker</strong><ul>\n<li>Added <code>env.verboseSolving</code> global. This is set to <code>true</code> when the code is run by the logical solver</li>\n<li>Added <code>SelfCountingComponent</code> constraint component</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>🛠️ Changed</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Improved feedback from the logical solver when a group of cells has too few candidates. Example:<ul>\n<li>Before: <blockquote>\n<p>✨ Naked quadruple in row 1: R1C1, R1C3, R1C5 and R1C7; removed 2, 4, 6 and 8 from R1C2, R1C4, R1C6, R1C8 and R1C9 → ❗Puzzle is impossible; R1C9 has no candidates</p>\n</blockquote>\n</li>\n<li>Now: <blockquote>\n<p>❗ This puzzle is broken: R1C1, R1C3, R1C5, R1C7 and R1C9 share only 4 candidates (2, 4, 6 and 8)</p>\n</blockquote>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>When duplicating a puzzle element, the name and other properties are now copied over as well</li>\n<li><strong>Constraint Maker</strong><ul>\n<li>Simplified <code>removeComponent</code> and <code>replaceComponent</code> <ul>\n<li><code>removeComponent(instance)</code> → <code>removeComponent()</code></li>\n<li><code>replaceComponent(instance, replacement)</code> → <code>replaceComponent(replacement)</code></li>\n<li>This change is backwards compatible; the first argument is simply ignored in existing custom constraints</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>🩹 Fixed</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Re-use last value</strong> setting for cosmetic text does not reset anymore when switching to a different element and back</li>\n<li>Fixed keyboard shortcuts sometimes not working in Firefox</li>\n<li>Various minor bug fixes and improvements</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Release 2026-02-22</h2>\n<h3>✨ Added</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Added link to official bug reports and feedback tracker.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>🩹 Fixed</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed issue where text strokes would disappear when &quot;Outlines on Digits&quot; in SudokuPad is turned off</li>\n<li>Fixed numpad not working in certain scenarios</li>\n<li>Various minor bug fixes and improvements</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Release 2026-01-03</h2>\n<h3>🛠️ Changed</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Renamed Sudoku Maker to SudokuMaker</li>\n<li>Updated app icon</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>🩹 Fixed</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Improved performance of sum logic of the solver</li>\n<li>Renamed &quot;Finned X-Wings&quot; to &quot;Almost X-Wings&quot; and made logical solver name the pattern more accurately (e.g. finned X-Wing, skyscraper, Sashimi X-Wing)</li>\n<li>Various minor bug fixes and improvements</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Release 2025-10-19</h2>\n<h3>✨ Added</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Constraint Maker</strong> <ul>\n<li>Added <code>ExactDigitCountComponent</code></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>🛠️ Changed</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>All code and JSON editors have improved syntax and error highlighting</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>🩹 Fixed</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Updated SudokuPad exports such that SudokuPad&#39;s anti-chess move parser does not add unwanted conflict checking</li>\n<li>Various minor bug fixes and improvements</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Release 2025-07-05</h2>\n<h3>✨ Added</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Dark mode</strong> - Toggle it via <em>Preferences &gt; Interface</em>.<br>The colors of puzzles can also be adapted to the dark theme, but this is currently experimental.</li>\n<li><strong>New/adaptable layouts</strong> - SudokuMaker is now more usable on certain resolutions than before.<br>Go to <em>Preferences &gt; Interface</em> to change your preferences.</li>\n<li><strong>Disable for solver</strong> - You can now make the solver ignore constraints, effectively turning them into cosmetics. This option is available in the three-dot action menu.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>🛠️ Changed</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>SudokuMaker is now considered <strong>beta</strong>.</li>\n<li>Some experimental features are now explicitly marked as <strong>alpha</strong>.</li>\n<li>Improved changelog</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>🩹 Fixed</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Constraint Maker</strong> - Cleaned up methods available in the <em>Implementation</em> section<ul>\n<li>Removed methods like <code>getValue</code> and <code>hasValue</code> which had no use in that section</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>Various minor bug fixes and improvements</li>\n</ul>\n`};export{e as changelog};\n"},"headersSize":-1,"bodySize":-1,"redirectURL":""},"cache":{},"timings":{"send":-1,"wait":-1,"receive":1.521},"_resourceType":"fetch"},{"startedDateTime":"2026-08-27T17:35:24.181Z","time":1.625,"request":{"method":"GET","url":"https://sudokumaker.app/manifest.webmanifest","httpVersion":"h3","cookies":[],"headers":[{"name":":authority","value":"sudokumaker.app"},{"name":":method","value":"GET"},{"name":":path","value":"/manifest.webmanifest"},{"name":":scheme","value":"https"},{"name":"accept","value":"*/*"},{"name":"accept-encoding","value":"gzip, deflate, br, zstd"},{"name":"cache-control","value":"no-cache"},{"name":"pragma","value":"no-cache"},{"name":"priority","value":"u=1, i"},{"name":"referer","value":"https://sudokumaker.app/sw.js"},{"name":"sec-fetch-dest","value":"empty"},{"name":"sec-fetch-mode","value":"cors"},{"name":"sec-fetch-site","value":"same-origin"},{"name":"user-agent","value":"Mozilla/5.0 (X11; Linux x86_64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) HeadlessChrome/151.0.7922.34 Safari/537.36"}],"queryString":[],"headersSize":-1,"bodySize":-1},"response":{"status":200,"statusText":"","httpVersion":"h3","cookies":[],"headers":[{"name":"access-control-allow-origin","value":"*"},{"name":"alt-svc","value":"h3=\":443\"; ma=86400"},{"name":"cache-control","value":"public, max-age=0, must-revalidate"},{"name":"cf-cache-status","value":"DYNAMIC"},{"name":"cf-ray","value":"a31cd51f7c1154bb-IAD"},{"name":"content-encoding","value":"br"}